  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s291/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></h2><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">🎈 שיחה בסמלים - מִצְווֹת מְסַפְּרוֹת</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👄 <b>פֶּה</b>:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי מְדַבֵּר רַק אֱמֶת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא מְשַׁקֵּר וְלֹא מְדַבֵּר לָשׁוֹן הָרַע.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👂 <b>אֹזֶן:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי לֹא מַקְשִׁיבָה לְרְכִילוּת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁמִּישֶׁהוּ מְדַבֵּר רַע עַל אֲחֵרִים - מַפְסִיקִים לִשְׁמֹעַ.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">✋ <b>יָּד:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי לֹא לוֹקַחַת מַה שֶׁלֹּא שֶׁלִּי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָסוּר לִגְנֹב, גַּם דָּבָר קָטָן.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">❤️ <b>הַלֵּב:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁמִּישֶׁהוּ צָרִיךְ עֶזְרָה - נוֹתְנִים אוֹתָהּ.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👟 <b>נַּעַל:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי לֹא מִתְעַלֶּמֶת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִם מִישֶׁהוּ נִפְגָּע - נִגָּשִׁים אֵלָיו אוֹ קוֹרְאִים לְעֶזְרָה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👕 <b>בֶּגֶד:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי מְלַמֵּד הִתְנַהֲגוּת מְכֻבֶּדֶת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִתְלַבְּשִׁים וּמִתְנַהֲגִים בִּצְנִיעוּת וּבְכָבוֹד.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👛 <b>אַרְנָק:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי שׁוֹמֵר עַל יֹשֶׁר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא לְרַמּוֹת בְּתַשְׁלוּם&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלֹא לִגְזֹל כֶּסֶף.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🪑 <b>כִּיסֵּא:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי מְפַנֶּה מָקוֹם.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קָמִים מִפְּנֵי זָקֵן אוֹ אִשָּׁה בְּהֵרָיוֹן.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🧠 <b>מֹּחַ:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי מִשְׁתַּדֵּל לַחֲשֹׁב רַק מַּחֲשָׁבוֹת טוֹבוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">⚖️ <b>מֹּאזְנַיִם:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שׁוֹקְלִים בְּיֹשֶׁר וְדִיּוּק:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פֵּרוֹת, יְּרָקוֹת, פִּצּוּחִים וְתַבְלִינִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌾 <b>שָּׂדֶה:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַשְׁאִירִים קְצָת לָעֲנִיִּים:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֶקֶט, שִׁכְחָה וּפֵאָה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🗓️ <b>לּוּחַ:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קְדוֹשִׁים כָּל הַשָּׁבוּעַ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא רַק בְּשַׁבָּת.</span></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת מצוות</span></span></h2></div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את 🔍 המצוות המוזכרות בפרשה: אָב, אֵם, שַׁבָּת, לֶקֶט, שִׁכְחָה, פֵּאָה, נְקָמָה, נְטִירָה, רְכִילוּת, שַׁעַטְנֵז, זָקֵן.<br />בכיוונים ⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span><br /><br /><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAyNCloDhSS0DIN2Cef_N2vLimHlHehLSMUqWGTZjzI3bER5Qxncs6EOlp1ABtBuA5_vFDRylt0uMjb3eSfnyInI7brK2bhd74rTlRxZhIHJyfJ8ivgPzX2Odn0CpqeShIkh7K9Bx-Mk3pO5qOLYKJ7qkERcGl5ia5uo5jIwPGiLgCaMTDiOC8fW_te5U/s462/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAyNCloDhSS0DIN2Cef_N2vLimHlHehLSMUqWGTZjzI3bER5Qxncs6EOlp1ABtBuA5_vFDRylt0uMjb3eSfnyInI7brK2bhd74rTlRxZhIHJyfJ8ivgPzX2Odn0CpqeShIkh7K9Bx-Mk3pO5qOLYKJ7qkERcGl5ia5uo5jIwPGiLgCaMTDiOC8fW_te5U/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></a><br /><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּפָרָשַׁת קְדוֹשִׁים הַתּוֹרָה מְצַוָּה לֹא לְשַׁקֵּר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֻתָּר לְדַבֵּר לָשׁוֹן הָרַע אִם זֶה רַק בִּצְחוֹק?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה מְצַוָּה לֹא לְהַקְשִׁיב לִרְכִילוּת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִצְוַת “מִפְּנֵי שֵׂיבָה תָּקוּם” עוֹסֶקֶת בְּכִבּוּד אֲנָשִׁים מְבֻגָּרִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צָרִיךְ לָקוּם רַק מִפְּנֵי כֹּהֵן אוֹ רַב, וְלֹא מִפְּנֵי כָּל זָקֵן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה מְצַוָּה לְהִתְנַהֵג בִּצְנִיעוּת וּבְכָבוֹד?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָסוּר לְרַמּוֹת בְּכֶסֶף אוֹ בְּתַשְׁלוּם?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֻתָּר לִנְקֹם בְּמִי שֶׁפָּגַע בִּי?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָסוּר לְשַׁנּוֹת קְצָת אֶת הַמִּשְׁקָל כְּדֵי לְהַרְוִיחַ יוֹתֵר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָסוּר לְהַנִּיחַ מִכְשׁוֹל בְּדַרְכּוֹ שֶׁל עִוֵּר?</span></li></ol>"
}
